{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"创世记","commonName":"创世记","title":"创世记","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"cce15cc7fd65c9f16227e0f34f3b0514633bfb9ef883e0936d6560885eb025fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1532},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["洪水消退"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["神记念挪亚和挪亚方舟里的一切走兽牲畜。 神叫风吹地，水势渐落。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["渊源和天上的窗户都闭塞了，天上的大雨也止住了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["水从地上渐退。过了一百五十天，水就渐消。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["七月十七日，方舟停在亚拉腊山上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["水又渐消，到十月初一日，山顶都现出来了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["过了四十天，挪亚开了方舟的窗户，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["放出一只乌鸦去；那乌鸦飞来飞去，直到地上的水都干了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他又放出一只鸽子去，要看看水从地上退了没有。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但遍地上都是水，鸽子找不着落脚之地，就回到方舟挪亚那里，挪亚伸手把鸽子接进方舟来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他又等了七天，再把鸽子从方舟放出去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["到了晚上，鸽子回到他那里，嘴里叼着一个新拧下来的橄榄叶子，挪亚就知道地上的水退了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他又等了七天，放出鸽子去，鸽子就不再回来了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["到挪亚六百零一岁，正月初一日，地上的水都干了。挪亚撤去方舟的盖观看，便见地面上干了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["到了二月二十七日，地就都干了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["神对挪亚说："]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["「你和你的妻子、儿子、儿妇都可以出方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["在你那里凡有血肉的活物，就是飞鸟、牲畜，和一切爬在地上的昆虫，都要带出来，叫它在地上多多滋生，大大兴旺。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["于是挪亚和他的妻子、儿子、儿妇都出来了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["一切走兽、昆虫、飞鸟，和地上所有的动物，各从其类，也都出了方舟。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["挪亚献祭"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["挪亚为耶和华筑了一座坛，拿各类洁净的牲畜、飞鸟献在坛上为燔祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和华闻那馨香之气，就心里说：「我不再因人的缘故咒诅地（人从小时心里怀着恶念），也不再按着我才行的灭各种的活物了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["地还存留的时候，稼穑、寒暑、冬夏、昼夜就永不停息了。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}